      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LaCrosse%2C_Washington",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "LaCrosse joined Washington’s Main Street program to market its historic downtown and preserve its heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
